SubSync - Modern SaaS Subscription & Membership Management Platform
====================================================================

Repository: https://github.com/menarayan15-boop/SubSync-Management-System
Framework: MERN Stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js)
UI Design: Light-mode Glassmorphism, Aurora Gradients, Bento Grid

Core Modules & Features:
1. SubSync Intelligence (AI Subscription Advisor, Contract Sentinel, Velocity Forecast)
2. Subscription Gifting Engine (Redeemable 16-character gift vouchers)
3. Skill Passport & Digital Vault (50+ curated developer & business PDF handbooks)
4. Family & Team Workspaces (Split billing & seat management)
5. Trust Center (Compliance, AES-256 security transparency, uptime monitor)
6. Smart Subscription Scanner (OCR invoice & receipt processing)
7. 1-Click Cancellation Assistant (Step-by-step guides & legal letters)
8. Subscription Budget Planner (Category limits, CSV/PDF financial export)
9. Discovery & Comparison Hub (Curated SaaS directory & side-by-side comparison)
10. Rewards & Loyalty Engine (Tier progression, referral links & voucher redemption)

For detailed technical documentation, please refer to subsync.md and README.md.
